OL,3,GNEWSAMinister tells council to 'get on'
OL,4,Awith homes plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has ordered North East
OL,7,FLincolnshire Council to submit its
OL,8,FLocal Plan by 31 December as scheduled
OL,9,F- just a day after councillors voted
OL,10,Fnot to go ahead with it.
OL,12,FThe Local Plan, which sets out how the
OL,13,Farea will develop up to 2032, has met
OL,14,Fsome opposition after the government
OL,15,Fset an increased target of 621 homes to
OL,16,Fbe built each year across North East
OL,17,FLincolnshire.
OL,19,FOn Thursday last week the Reform UK-led
OL,20,Fcouncil voted not to take the draft
OL,21,FLocal Plan forward to the Regulation 19
OL,22,Fconsultation stage.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
