OL,3,GNEWSAMinister tells council to 'get on'
OL,4,Awith homes plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, Housing and Planning Minister
OL,7,FMatthew Pennycook intervened on Friday
OL,8,Fand directed the council to progress
OL,9,Fthe plan, saying it was "the
OL,10,Fcornerstone of our planning system".
